

Gahunda imicungire-yububiko: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Ukuri.
>> a := Urutonde ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Ikintu gishya.
c bigeze: ['greet:'] kora: { Ibisohoka andika: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Gahunda sukura.
>> usedMemory1 := (Gahunda ububiko ? 0).




